                                                                        <tr>
                                        <td style="padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;word-break: break-word">The lecturer explains business mathematics concepts very clearly and provides practical examples that help students understand how mathematics is applied in business situations. The class atmosphere is engaging and supportive, which makes learning easier and more interesting. So student friendly and interactive class. My favourite tr</td>
